# docker/tor/torrc
#
# DamageBDD Tor sidecar.
#
# Provides:
#   - SOCKS5 proxy on tor:9050 for container egress
#   - optional onion services for Bitcoin Core, Core Lightning, and DamageBDD API
#
# Security:
#   - Do not expose SOCKSPort publicly.
#   - Do not expose ControlPort unless authentication is configured.
#   - /var/lib/tor contains onion service identity keys.

DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

# SOCKS proxy used by DamageBDD, Bitcoin Core, and Core Lightning.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
SOCKSPolicy accept 172.16.0.0/12
SOCKSPolicy accept 192.168.0.0/16
SOCKSPolicy accept 10.0.0.0/8
SOCKSPolicy reject *

# Keep DNS leaks down for SOCKS-aware applications.
SafeSocks 1
TestSocks 1

# Log to container stdout.
Log notice stdout

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Core Lightning onion service
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# After first start, read the onion address with:
#   docker compose exec tor cat /var/lib/tor/lightning/hostname
# Then set CLN_ANNOUNCE_ADDR=<hostname>.onion:9735 in .env and uncomment
# the --announce-addr line in the lightning command.
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/lightning/
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 9735 lightning:9735

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Bitcoin P2P onion service
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This publishes bitcoin:8333 as a v3 onion service.
# Read the onion address with:
#   docker compose exec tor cat /var/lib/tor/bitcoin/hostname
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/bitcoin/
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 8333 bitcoin:8333

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional DamageBDD API onion service
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uncomment if you want the DamageBDD HTTP API reachable over Tor.
# Onion transport does not replace normal application auth/rate limits.
#
# HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/damagebdd-api/
# HiddenServiceVersion 3
# HiddenServicePort 80 damagebdd:4888
